        <excerpt>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[Selecting an offshore customer support partner marks the start of the journey. Long-term success depends on effective onboarding, operational alignment, and shared accountability during the first ninety days of the partnership.]]></Value>
    </excerpt>
